# The runtime prelude embedded in every emitted program, expressed as
# PatLang source. Regenerate after changing the host codegen template:
#   pat --ir-run self_hosting/tools/dump_prelude.patlang
#   python self_hosting/tools/transcribe_prelude.py
# emit_runtime_rs() reproduces runtime/prelude.rs byte-for-byte
# (parity-checked against codegen_prelude() by the test suite).
# =============================================================================

